@startuml
title Online Retrieval-Augmented Translation Workflow
skinparam shadowing false

start

:User enters an English sentence;
:Normalize text and protect input format;
:Generate query embedding using LaBSE;
:Search the FAISS ANN index;
:Fetch candidate bilingual pairs from TM DB;
:Rank candidates and check similarity threshold;

if (Any candidate passes\ninitial threshold 0.75?) then (Yes)
  :Select top-k accepted matches;
  :Build context from bilingual examples;
else (No)
  :Use empty retrieved context;
  :Enable baseline translation fallback;
endif

:Preserve named entities, numbers and dates;
:Compose input and retrieval context;
:Apply IndicNLP preprocessing;
:Perform planned script unification;
:Tokenize using SentencePiece;
:Add target language tag;

:Generate target sequence with IndicTrans2;

:Restore native script;
:Detokenize output;
:Restore protected entities;

:Return final translation;
:Display translation and retrieved examples;

stop
@enduml